},\n  \"required\": [\n    \"target_profile\"\n  ],\n  \"title\": \"ConsensusAuditSpec\",\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n['Activity', 'Behavior', 'CoreOverview', 'CorePath', 'Fact', 'Surface', 'TargetProfile']\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The leader creates a fresh quorum tracker for each term and requires replication of an entry from that term before advancing commitment. Membership changes also wait for the previous configuration to commit. I’m tracing how replies, log conflicts and recovery interact with those protections.\n"}}
