pend responses update nextIndex and report last sent entry to the captured commitment tracker.'],important_branches=['Local store error fails futures and sets Follower.','Rejection backs nextIndex down; missing retained logs switches to snapshot transfer; newer response term signals stepdown.','CommitTimeout sends ordinary replication even without new commands; separate heartbeats carry no commit index.'],produces_fact_ids=['f-match'],async_boundaries=['Network request/response and optional pipeline run outside main loop.'])\nbeh('b-commit','A1','commitment mutex; Raft main-loop commit channel consumer','One leader tracker and its latest voter set','match or setConfiguration recalculates majority index; notification wakes leader loop',['s-commit','s-leader-loop'],implementation_guards=['Only current voter IDs are recorded; match values increase monotonically.','Quorum index must reach startIndex before commitment advances.'],writes=['Set commitment index and notify; main loop updates Raft commit index and committed configuration, then processes inflight prefix.'],consumes_fact_ids=['f-match'],produces_fact_ids=['f-committed'],cross_activity_effects={'A5':'Committed inflight prefix is queued to FSM processing.','A2':'Committed removal of local voter triggers shutdown or follower transition.'})\nbeh('b-follower-append','A1','Raft RPC handler','Incoming leader term and local retained log/snapshot','AppendEntries through normal RPC or heartbeat dispatch',['s-append','s-config-log','s-process'],implementation_guards=['Reject old term; newer term or ordinary non-follower state transitions to follower.','Check previous index/term; delete conflicting suffix before storing replacement entries.'],writes=['Revert latest configuration to committed when truncating through latest configuration.','On success set commit index to min(leader commit index, local last index), update committed configuration and process prefix.'],produces_fact_ids=['f-committed'],cross_activity_effects={